'''Palandags''' were a [[Sentience|sentient]] [[species]] that lived in [[the galaxy]]. They were notable for having an exolung.<ref name="Rules of the Game" /> [[Dhuz]], [[Hhex]], and [[Jhat]] were Palandags who worked as [[musician]]s.<ref name="Visual Dictionary" /> Palandags' language was comprised of sounds that some considered to be naturally musical.

